cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code, or results derived from it, please cite the thesis below."
title: "Decomposing the Modality Gap: Single-Axis Attribution of Representation Geometry in Multimodal Large Language Models"
abstract: >-
  Code and experiments for a four-axis decomposition of the modality gap in a
  connector-based multimodal large language model. Each axis (location, scale,
  shape, orientation) is driven in isolation while the other three are pinned,
  giving a single-axis attribution of caption quality.
type: software
